iGPSPORT series of code table management tools, is your riding assistant!

Using the igpsport series APP, you can complete the data management of the code table without having to turn on the computer, including:
● Quickly connect the device to obtain the basic information of the code table, including: version number, device ID, software / hardware version number, line summary information;
● access the code table data through Bluetooth into the phone for inspection;
● delete the code table line;
● Read / set code table configuration information;

At the same time can be on the user's data online synchronization management, including:
● Synchronize personal information on the website, including: height, weight and other personal basic information;
● Upload / download line data for riding
● Synchronize cycling distance, burn calories, and increase heart rate to Apple Health

